/unit_type/1722506/d9b2c78c-cc69-43e2-9387-1dc192560be9.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Enjoy a comfortable stay in this newly renovated one-bedroom apartment in Schweinfurt, offering the perfect balance of modern living, comfort, and excellent connectivity. Thoughtfully designed with a minimalist interior, the apartment features a spacious living area, a fully equipped kitchen, a comfortable bedroom, a modern bathroom, and a private balcony. Whether you’re relocating, working on a business project, or planning a longer stay, this apartment provides everything you need to feel at home.\n\n⸻\n\nThe space\n\nThis bright 60 m2 apartment has been carefully furnished with modern, high-quality furniture to create a stylish and practical living environment.\n\nThe apartment includes:\n\n• Spacious living room with comfortable sofa, dining area and Smart TV\n• Cozy bedroom with premium double bed and ample storage\n• Dedicated workspace ideal for remote work\n• Fully equipped kitchen with:\n\n* Dishwasher\n* Oven\n* Refrigerator\n* Washing machine\n* Cookware, dishes and kitchen essentials\n\n• Modern bathroom with bathtub and shower\n• Private balcony with outdoor seating\n• High-speed WiFi throughout the apartment\n• Entrance area with wardrobe and shoe storage\n\nThe apartment is located in a quiet residential building, offering a peaceful atmosphere while remaining close to the city’s main business areas and transport connections.\n\n⸻\n\nLocation\n\nThe apartment enjoys an excellent location with quick access to both the city centre and major employers.\n\nNearby you’ll find:\n\n• Schweinfurt City Centre – approximately 8–10 minutes by bus\n• Schweinfurt Main Station (Schweinfurt Hauptbahnhof) – around 10–15 minutes by public transport, with regional train connections towards Würzburg, Bamberg and Erfurt.  \n• Supermarkets, bakeries, pharmacies and restaurants within a few minutes.  \n\nThe apartment is also well located for employees of major companies including:\n\n• SKF\n• Schaeffler\n• ZF Friedrichshafen\n• Bosch Rexroth\n\n⸻\n\nTransport\n\nExcellent public transport and road connections make commuting simple.\n\n• Nearest bus stop: approximately 1 minute on foot\n• Regular city bus services provide quick access to the city centre and Schweinfurt Hauptbahnhof.\n• Fast access to B286\n• Only a few minutes’ drive to the A70 motorway\n• Quick connection to the A71 motorway, ideal for travel towards Würzburg, Bamberg, Erfurt and surrounding business locations.  \n\n⸻\n\nGuest access\n\nGuests have exclusive access to the entire apartment.\n\nIncluded:\n\n• Entire apartment\n• Private bedroom\n• Living room\n• Fully equipped kitchen\n• Bathroom\n• Private balcony\n• Washing machine\n• High-speed WiFi\n• Building entrance and common areas\n• Private garage parking (if included with your reservation)\n\nYou will have complete privacy throughout your stay.\n\n⸻\n\nOther things to note\n\n• Quiet residential building\n• Ideal for professionals, business travelers, couples and long-term stays\n• High-speed WiFi throughout the apartment\n• Dedicated workspace\n• No parties or events\n• Smoking is only permitted on the balcony\n• Please respect the building’s quiet hours and neighboring residents.\n\nPlease note: The photos shown are for reference purposes. The apartment layout remains the same, while furniture, decoration and styling may vary slightly depending on availability.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":